Hello,<br><br>I'm sorry if I've missed this somewhere, I did search the forums and saw that it was suggested before a while back.<br><br>I'm on a large, closed network down here in Florida and OpenGD77 has taken off with the userbase here. Unfortunately we've come to a problem where there are a lot of people doubling over each other. What would it take to add Admit Criteria like the commercial Land Mobile stuff has? Color code free seems to be the suggested preference from the adminitstrator (He mostly runs Motorola stuff).<br><br>I'm not a developer but this is definitely a feature that would be helpful so that OpenGD77 users can be courteous to other hams. If there's any suggestions or ways I could help this get implemented, please let me know.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8291">KQ4TVB</a> — Wed Mar 19, 2025 12:19 am</p><hr />
